# 240 (AUDIT-v197). THE REPOSITORY IS PUBLIC and a leaked key cannot be un-leaked - scanning bots
# archive public repos within minutes and a fork survives the repo going private again. Checked
# before adding this rather than after: `git log --all --diff-filter=A -- .env` is EMPTY, so nothing
# is being hidden retroactively and no history rewrite is owed. API keys live in Vercel env vars and
# this line exists so the one careless `.env` never gets the chance.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
